5. Design Zero-shot, One-shot, and Few-shot Prompts to Generate a Promotional Social Media Post for an AI Workshop
Zero-shot Prompt

Prompt:

Write a promotional social media post for an AI Workshop. Highlight the workshop's benefits, encourage participation, and include a call to action. Keep the tone engaging and suitable for platforms like Instagram, LinkedIn, or Facebook.

One-shot Prompt

Prompt:

Example:

Task: Write a promotional social media post for a Python Programming Workshop.

Post:
 Join our Python Programming Workshop and learn coding from industry experts! Gain hands-on experience, work on real-world projects, and earn a certificate. Register today and kick-start your programming journey! #Python #Coding #Workshop

Now write a similar promotional post for an AI Workshop.

Few-shot Prompt

Prompt:

Example 1:
 Join our Web Development Workshop and build responsive websites with expert guidance. Register now!

Example 2:

 Master Data Science through hands-on projects and practical sessions. Limited seats available—Enroll today!

Example 3:

 Learn Cybersecurity fundamentals from industry professionals. Gain practical skills and earn a certificate. Sign up now!

Now generate a promotional social media post for an AI Workshop.

