Comparison
Criteria	Zero-shot	One-shot	Few-shot
Creativity	Good	Better	Excellent
Tone	Engaging	Professional	Highly Engaging
Structure	Simple	Well-organized	Most polished
Completeness	Covers basic details	Includes benefits	Includes benefits, CTA, and hashtags
Overall Quality	Good	Very Good	Best

Conclusion:

Zero-shot generates a basic promotional post without examples.
One-shot improves quality by following one example.
Few-shot produces the most engaging and professional social media post with a strong call to action and effective formatting.
